## 🔥 The Commitment

**品質妥協版禁止** (NoSimpleFallbackGate)
```
Forbidden file names:
- simple_*, simplified_*, シンプル
- fast_*, quick_*, 高速, rapid_
- 簡易, lite_*, minimal_*, basic_

Forbidden comments:
- "simplified version"
- "quick implementation"
- "temporary solution"
- "fallback", "mock implementation"
```

We don't do "good enough."
We do "right."

